Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Soo-Sum Lean work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 102, "text": "Title: The Academic Odyssey of Soo-Sum Lean: Unraveling the Ties with National University of Singapore"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 104, "end": 268, "text": "In the realm of academia, where the pursuit of knowledge and innovation reigns supreme, the name Soo-Sum Lean echoes through the corridors of esteemed institutions."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 269, "end": 387, "text": "Among these, the National University of Singapore (NUS) stands tall, a beacon of excellence in research and education."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 388, "end": 531, "text": "It is here that our narrative converges, as we delve into the fascinating story of Soo-Sum Lean's association with this prestigious university."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 532, "end": 558, "text": "Chapter 1: The Early Years"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 560, "end": 714, "text": "Soo-Sum Lean's academic journey began with a passion for discovery, nurtured by a curiosity that drove him to explore the intricacies of his chosen field."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 715, "end": 850, "text": "As he navigated the early years of his career, Lean's reputation as a meticulous researcher and dedicated educator began to take shape."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 851, "end": 1002, "text": "It was only a matter of time before his talents would be recognized by institutions of repute, and NUS would soon become an integral part of his story."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1003, "end": 1032, "text": "Chapter 2: The NUS Connection"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1034, "end": 1130, "text": "A thorough